# ZMPGRAPH - graphs Y₁ from X=U to X=V with a window that fits it.
# Uses U,V,W as scratch (they are changed).
Func
PlotsOff
FnOff
FnOn 1
GraphColor(1,BLUE)
AxesOn
GridOff
LabelOff
ExprOff
# Set Xmin very low first so Xmax can never be "below" Xmin
⁻1ᴇ90→Xmin
V→Xmax
U→Xmin
(V-U)/10→Xscl
ZoomFit
# Add 1/8 padding and make sure the x-axis (y=0) is visible
Ymax-Ymin→W
If W=0
1→W
min(0,Ymin-W/8)→U
max(0,Ymax+W/8)→V
⁻1ᴇ90→Ymin
V→Ymax
U→Ymin
(V-U)/10→Yscl
ClrDraw
DispGraph
